<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the German first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p> 14 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe)</p>
<p> 11 -  Ulf Kirsten, Paulo Sergio (both Bayer Leverkusen)	 </p>
<p> 10 -  Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Bernhard Winkler (1860 Munich), Jonathan Akpoborie (Hansa Rostock), Martin Max (Schalke), Fredi Bobic, Giovane Elber (both VfB Stuttgart)</p>
